msgctxt "54\t114"
msgid "Nice work out there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292\t416"
msgid "Kiryu-chan, you were shining like a\\nstar back there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "407\t535"
msgid ""
"It's as if your eyes have seen death itself,\\nand the scars of war were "
"written on your back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "558\t627"
msgid "Right? Doesn't he have that vibe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628\t728"
msgid "Yeah! S-Sure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732\t910"
msgid ""
"If you're not already with a production agency,\\nyou should sign a contract"
" with us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "911\t1021"
msgid "Right, guys!? Tell me I'm not crazy here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1097\t1179"
msgid "That's a terrible idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180\t1294"
msgid "What are you saying?\\nAnd why's everyone lined up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1285\t1472"
msgid ""
"Sorry. But I'm not interested in acting.\\nI should be leaving now anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1486\t1544"
msgid "Thanks for leaving our pinkies on⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1545\t1658"
msgid "I mean, I'm tickled pink to have worked with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1766\t1837"
msgid "What's gotten into you guys?"
msgstr "Ma che ti è preso?"

msgctxt "1847\t1905"
msgid "\"The Legendary Yakuza:\\nBased on a True Story\""
msgstr ""
